{
  "id": "UXee73E3T34gpqnt",
  "name": "Example: hardened fetch-and-append",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Example: a hardened sync\nThe same fetch-and-append every tutorial shows, with the kit applied:\n\n- HTTP Request: **Retry On Fail** (3× / 3 s), **Timeout** 15 s, **On Error → continue (error output)** wired to *Stop and Error* so a failure is loud instead of an empty item.\n- **Any rows?** guards the write; zero rows is an error, not a quiet success.\n- After the write, **Assert Outcome** checks the count and returns a receipt.\n- Workflow settings: **Error Workflow → Error Router**, timeout 10 min.\n\nReplace the placeholder URL and the Sheets node with your own; the shape is the point.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "662a80cf-f724-4e37-a436-003e972805ca",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "218c0808-1b16-4698-a620-7d255212a83b",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -160,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.example.com/v1/records?updated_since={{ $now.minus({ minutes: 15 }).toISO() }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "c4c83570-38c3-454c-8362-3226a27b4e6e",
      "name": "Fetch records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        60,
        40
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorType": "errorMessage",
        "errorMessage": "=Fetch records failed after retries: {{ $json.error?.message ?? JSON.stringify($json.error) }}"
      },
      "id": "f5b9cf12-3cf4-48dd-9fe1-65f3bc57f97d",
      "name": "Fetch failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "8908fb04-fce0-4031-bf74-eb5d282375c7",
              "leftValue": "={{ $input.all().length }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              },
              "rightValue": 0
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9558c2ff-00f2-4dab-b44d-c57a5e280039",
      "name": "Any rows?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Records"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b74b0463-feb7-4481-baa2-436f3d1d5075",
      "name": "Append rows to sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        540,
        -60
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorType": "errorMessage",
        "errorMessage": "Fetch returned 0 records. Either the source is quiet (raise the window) or the response shape changed."
      },
      "id": "786de5d6-1954-4bf6-a60b-2635695c5489",
      "name": "Nothing to write",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Turn 'how many items reached this point' into a single check item for Assert Outcome.\nconst n = $input.all().length;\nreturn [{ json: { label: 'rows appended to the sheet', actual: n, min: 1, max: 5000, context: `${$workflow.name} #${$execution.id}` } }];"
      },
      "id": "3706db9b-8447-4912-9f91-b21e97d32900",
      "name": "Count what was written",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        780,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_ASSERT_OUTCOME_ID",
          "cachedResultName": "Assert Outcome (sub-workflow)"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "label": "={{ $json.label }}",
            "actual": "={{ $json.actual }}",
            "min": "={{ $json.min }}",
            "max": "={{ $json.max }}",
            "context": "={{ $json.context }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "label",
              "displayName": "label",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "actual",
              "displayName": "actual",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "min",
              "displayName": "min",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "max",
              "displayName": "max",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "context",
              "displayName": "context",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      },
      "id": "20a91504-5dd0-4360-978c-76c592a57322",
      "name": "Assert Outcome",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "13ad3086-28d9-46df-9318-a969fb6480fb",
      "name": "Done (receipt)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        -60
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 15 minutes": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch records",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch records": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Any rows?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch failed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Any rows?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
